# 项目内临时权重仍忽略；仓库 weights/ 中的模型由 Git LFS 管理
*.pth
*.pt
!weights/*.pth
!weights/*.pt
weights/**/.cache/

# 输入图片与输出标注
images/*
!images/.gitkeep
annotations/*
!annotations/.gitkeep

# 微调产物
yolo_dataset/
runs/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/

# 临时文件
*.part
_tmp_train/

# PyInstaller 打包产物
build/
dist/
